              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elomanari Esacaradoti ŋolo Apolon nooi ŋolo a Ŋiyudayan Nakibois ŋina Asegan nooi alomaret apei bon a ŋolokaru etiŋit ŋaokot ŋuna a ibarasit, meere ŋuna keŋ. Nai pa alomari Kristo nen, ikotere inakinor ŋarwa ŋuna alalak, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
