              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae kerae kikote nen, kisicanitae iŋes ŋarwa ŋuna alalak ŋinapei ka asubunet Akuj akwap. Akilo, abu iŋes bu abunet apei ŋina itemokino jik tari nasalunet, ikotere tolema asecit anamuronot keŋ ke elope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.26"
            ]
          }
