        {
          "text": "Ikwaŋinapei, alemunio Kristo daŋ alemunet apei toruwor amuronot ŋina elemari ŋasecisya a ŋikalalak. Etakanuni iŋes atakanunet ŋina a ŋaarei, meere aŋuna ka alemar ŋasecisya, nai aiun ŋulu idarito iŋes.",
